<<
/Title (The project successfully demonstrated the core NoSQL operations required for managing a student dataset in MongoDB. The original dataset contained 50 student documents, and the queries were executed to retrieve, filter, modify, delete and organize the records.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 425 0 R
/First 574 0 R
/Last 575 0 R
/Count -3
/Next 496 0 R
>>
