497 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project provided practical knowledge of NoSQL databases using MongoDB. A Student Management System containing student information was created and different MongoDB operations were performed on the data. Through this project, I learned how to insert, retrieve, update and delete documents. I also learned how to sort data in ascending and descending order, how comparison operators such as $eq, $gt, $lt, $gte and $lte work, and how logical operators such as $and and $or can be used to combine conditions.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 357 0 R
/Prev 426 0 R
/Next 578 0 R
>>
endobj
